# ⭐ Key Features

## 1. AI-Based Human Detection

The system uses computer vision and an object detection model to identify humans from camera feeds.

Possible models:

* YOLO
* YOLOv8
* YOLOv11
* MobileNet SSD
* OpenCV-based detection

---

## 2. Restricted Zone Detection

The system can define virtual restricted areas.

Example:

```text
Camera View

+--------------------------------------+
|                                      |
|       Normal Surveillance Area       |
|                                      |
|              ┌──────────┐            |
|              │ RESTRICT │            |
|              │   ZONE   │            |
|              └──────────┘            |
|                    👤                |
|                                      |
+--------------------------------------+
```

If a detected person enters the restricted zone, the system generates an intrusion event.

