# 🤖 AI Detection Logic

The AI model receives frames from a camera.

```text
Camera Frame
     ↓
Image Preprocessing
     ↓
YOLO Detection
     ↓
Detect Person
     ↓
Calculate Confidence
     ↓
Check Restricted Zone
     ↓
Intrusion / Normal
```

Example:

```python
if detected_object == "person":
    if confidence >= CONFIDENCE_THRESHOLD:
        if inside_restricted_zone(person):
            generate_intrusion_alert()
```

