# ⚠️ Ethical & Safety Considerations

This project is intended as a **research and educational prototype**.

AI detection systems can produce false positives and false negatives. Therefore:

* AI predictions should not automatically determine real-world enforcement actions.
* Human verification should remain part of the response process.
* Data should be securely stored.
* Camera footage should be handled according to applicable laws and policies.
* Facial recognition or biometric features should only be implemented where legally and ethically appropriate.
* Testing should be conducted in controlled environments.

